# cmux-mr-review projects, one per line:
#   <host/project-path glob> <label> <local repo path>
# The glob is matched against the MR URL's host and project path, so `*` can
# cover a project that moved between groups. The label ends up in the workspace
# name ("MR !42 server"). Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# gitlab.com/my-group/*/my-server  server  ~/code/my-server
# gitlab.com/my-group/*/my-web     web     ~/code/my-web
